[00:00.265]Hush don't speak   
{"嘘　别说话"}
[00:03.434]When you spit your venom  
{"当你喷吐毒液时"}
[00:05.925]Keep it shut I hate it   
{"闭嘴　我受够了"}
[00:11.336]About your new messiah
{"关于你所谓的新救世主"}
[00:13.469]Cause your theories catch fire
{"因为你的理论会引火烧身"}
[00:15.376]I can't find your silver lining
{"我找不到你的闪光点"}
[00:19.603]I don't mean to judge
{"我不想妄加评判"}
[00:22.664]But when you read your speech it's tiring
{"但听你念稿子实在令人疲惫"}
[00:26.883]Enough is enough
{"适可而止吧"}
[00:30.487]I'm covering my ears like a kid
{"我像孩子般捂住耳朵"}
[00:34.100]When your words mean nothing
{"当你的话语毫无意义"}
[00:36.387]I go la la la
[00:38.175]I'm turning up the volume when you speak
{"当你开口时我会调高音量"}
[00:41.516]Cause if my heart can't stop it
{"若我的心无法阻挡"}
[00:45.812]I'll find a way to block it I go
{"我会想办法屏蔽　就这样"}
[00:49.322]La-la la-la-la-la-la na-na-na-na-na
