{"我会想办法屏蔽　就这样"}
[00:56.953]La-la-na-na la-la-la-la-la na-na-na-na-na
[00:59.454]La-la-na-na la-la-la-la-la na-na-na-na-na
[01:01.516]If our love is running out of time
{"如果我们的爱正在倒计时"}
[01:05.116]I won't count the hours
{"我不会数着时间"}
[01:06.888]Rather be a coward
{"宁愿做个懦夫"}
[01:09.040]When our words collide
{"当言语交锋时"}
[01:12.801]I'm gonna drown you out before I lose my mind
{"在失去理智前　我要盖过你的声音"}
[01:16.795]I can't find your silver lining
{"我找不到你的闪光点"}
[01:20.610]I don't mean to judge
{"并非刻意评判"}
